data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_MVQV8zYqE3EELVDeRsuaktLM"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: An aqueduct that feeds the Sablecross reservoir and comes from the Basalt Hills. The Sablecross council owns it, and Mira Venn maintains it.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← MAINTAINS from Mira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintains the Glass Aqueduct. She was born in Sablecross. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  - ← OWNS from Sablecross council (council, governing body) [ID: ccb30b2e-6e33-42d7-a6d2-a754da506f10]: The owner of the Glass Aqueduct.\n  - ← PLANS_FOR from Original aqueduct plans (plans, document) [ID: d5476f0a-57e4-43dc-b873-003fd4024e30]: The original aqueduct plans, kept in the Sun Archive.\n  - FEEDS → Sablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, fed by the Glass Aqueduct.\n  - RUNS_FROM → Basalt Hills (hills, geographic feature) [ID: 2ec99b4b-9d81-4b3e-8da3-e77d88559be1]: Hills from which the Glass Aqueduct comes.\n\nSablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, fed by the Glass Aqueduct.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← FEEDS from Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: An aqueduct that feeds the Sablecross reservoir and comes from the Basalt Hills. The Sablecross council owns it, and Mira Venn maintains it.\n  - ← GUARDS from Oren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n  - LOCATED_IN → Sablecross (city) [ID: 1016d1ca-4f7d-4d74-bdc6-6522d6bb1947]: A city in Ardent Reach.\n\nSablecross council (council, governing body) [ID: ccb30b2e-6e33-42d7-a6d2-a754da506f10]: The owner of the Glass Aqueduct.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - OWNS → Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: An aqueduct that feeds the Sablecross reservoir and comes from the Basalt Hills. The Sablecross council owns it, and Mira Venn maintains it.\n\nBasalt Hills (hills, geographic feature) [ID: 2ec99b4b-9d81-4b3e-8da3-e77d88559be1]: Hills from which the Glass Aqueduct comes.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← RUNS_FROM from Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: An aqueduct that feeds the Sablecross reservoir and comes from the Basalt Hills. The Sablecross council owns it, and Mira Venn maintains it.\n\nOriginal aqueduct plans (plans, document) [ID: d5476f0a-57e4-43dc-b873-003fd4024e30]: The original aqueduct plans, kept in the Sun Archive.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← CONTAINS from Sun Archive (archive) [ID: e7e97d97-f1a0-4a74-98e5-6f4cd1c78282]: An archive kept by Lysa Renn. It contains the original aqueduct plans.\n  - PLANS_FOR → Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: An aqueduct that feeds the Sablecross reservoir and comes from the Basalt Hills. The Sablecross council owns it, and Mira Venn maintains it."}]}}

